==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

